  "sourceTitle": "Neon Ladder: a playtest-graded benchmark for local LLM stacks — your config is the subject, a working game is the grade",
  "sourceBodyHash": "a25be0d637222e798cc77b7632007e9d114107fca0e68d35d75cc5f4f26779fb",
